WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.769
Phishing is when criminals pretend to be someone you trust, to trick you.

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:09.569
Watch for urgency or fear: your account will be blocked in one hour!

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:12.771
Watch for prizes that need a small fee to collect.

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:17.236
Any message asking for a PIN, password or code is a scam.

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:20.208
And be careful with links you did not expect.

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:24.639
Stop. Don't click, reply or call the number in the message.

00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:29.629
Check using an official number or app you already trust, then report it.

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:40.176
Before you move on, check: Name three warning signs of phishing. Check a suspicious message using an official contact. Know what to do if you clicked a bad link.

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:44.324
In the next lesson: Mobile money safety.
